  m_text: '<b>Cards</b>

    Drawn for this project (CC0); rank letters in Noto Serif.


    <b>Fonts</b>

    Cinzel,
    Noto Serif and Amiri (Arabic), SIL Open Font License 1.1.


    <b>Emoji</b>

    "Emoji
    Set" by SunKing2 on Openclipart, public domain (CC0).


    <b>Interface design</b>

    Tarneeb
    VIP gameplay UI, designed in Figma.


    <b>Portraits</b>

    Omar and Khalid:
    AI-generated (Pollinations). Ahmad and Sara: from the Figma design.


    <b>Icons,
    effects, sound and music</b>

    Original and generated for this project (CC0).


    <b>Multiplayer</b>

    Photon
    PUN 2 (Exit Games).


    Made with Unity.'
